      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13586/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook and stir sausage in a large, deep skillet over medium-high heat until evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Remove sausage from the skillet with a slotted spoon and drain on a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pquii_9r7RPM533g6zm1opUZHSk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13586-best-sausage-stuffing-step-02-4x3-2edcc11a5ae742f5bccb616946393124.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13586/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour pan drippings into a liquid measure. Add as much melted butter as needed to measure 1 cup; pour back into the skillet and place over medium heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4coKyE8EV0G_uDpO6IUcrrv22WU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13586-best-sausage-stuffing-step-04-4x3-72c8133a69214c9c8d703c7c776c2718.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13586/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add celery and onion to the skillet; cook and stir until onion is tender but not browned, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/f6iMfTEvB7f5-iKKhstTYX4vaR4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13586-best-sausage-stuffing-step-006-4x3-840c2c4a41b249259fc08cdd30025870.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13586/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add 1/3 of the bread cubes and stir to moisten.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m5nXEaosopON9qhKfTrOKXWA47Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13586-best-sausage-stuffing-step-007-4x3-4c7e31b9402d4bb0819c61c414874278.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13586/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer bread and onion mixture to a large bowl. Add sausage, remaining bread cubes, poultry seasoning, and pepper; stir until well combined, using caution as it will be hot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
